".Sh SYNOPSIS\n"
"To compile this driver into the kernel, add this line to the\n"
"kernel configuration file:\n"
".Bd -ragged -offset indent\n"
".Cd \"device exampledriver\"\n"
".Ed\n"
".Pp\n"
"To load the driver as a module at boot, add this line to\n"
".Xr loader.conf 5 :\n"
